#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9435 expect=violation domain=TX
# Rule:Description: CDISC-SEND-9435 — the Required key TXPARMCD is not populated.
#note "TXPARMCD blank -> violation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of TXPARMCD."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TX
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col SETCD type=Char
col TXSEQ type=Char
col TXPARMCD type=Char
col TXPARM type=Char
col TXVAL type=Char
---
S1      | TX     | GRP1  | 1     |          | Treatment Dose | 10
---
